# device-layer-0008.
# Handing things to the platform: an address opened by whatever handles it, and text offered through the share
# sheet. UIApplication.open and UIActivityViewController on iOS, NSWorkspace and NSSharingServicePicker on macOS,
# an ACTION_VIEW intent and the ACTION_SEND chooser on Android, java.awt.Desktop on a desktop JVM, window.open and
# navigator.share in a browser.
#
#   open-address(address)   opened, or unavailable when nothing handles it, or denied when the platform refused
#   share-text(text)        shown (the sheet is up, and the person decides), denied (a browser refuses a share it
#                           was not asked for by a click), or unavailable
#
# A host with no such capability (the server, the memory host) answers `unavailable`. Every answer is text from the
# closed set above, so an app compares strings and no platform enum ever reaches it.

load ./native/{platform}/open
  find hand-address
  find present-share

task open-address
  take address, like text
  like text
  send back
    call hand-address
      read address

task share-text
  take text, like text
  like text
  send back
    call present-share
      read text
